  (text
    "J6 is on the box wall, wired to two pads on the board."
    (at 287.02 200.66 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "628005b5-e3af-595b-ae41-ee6d9bb4abd6"))
  (text
    "It connects only to J5's DC pins: 4, 5 (+) and 7, 8 (-)."
    (at 287.02 203.2 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "0c037c09-5f4f-54e5-be7f-c371e3c0e269"))
  (text
    "DC- joins board ground at NT1 and nowhere else;"
    (at 287.02 205.74 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "720030b2-d20a-5ad3-a0b1-a0e55b507f8c"))
  (text
    "DC+ touches no board net (HARDWARE.md §16, bench check 4)."
    (at 287.02 208.28 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "5f3fac1d-b41c-5907-8c7c-510608cf22c4"))
  (text
    "J6 pin 1 is taken as the centre contact, centre positive [I];"
    (at 287.02 210.82 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "a69af5f6-5ed0-5be3-942e-0518d6e9852e"))
  (text
    "the panel's adapter sets the voltage and polarity."
    (at 287.02 213.36 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "bf6b925f-4a6b-5fb0-948d-0e876f60059b"))
  (text
    "Notes"
    (at 15.24 186.69 0)
    (effects (font (size 2 2) bold) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "67b3672b-aa4a-59ab-bb15-32e780766945"))
  (text
    "1. Pins 2 and 5 pass straight through each zone: K1-V1 and K2-V2 share"
    (at 15.24 189.69 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "e06f9367-839c-5845-9013-50e9cc164bb7"))
  (text
    "   GND and VALVEn_12V7. Pin 5 touches no other board net (§5, §9)."
    (at 15.24 192.69 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "945f45b6-b67c-59a8-a83d-7f298839d08e"))
  (text
    "2. One board ground joins both zones' pin 2 and the panel's DC-. If the"
    (at 15.24 195.69 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "c28e2bef-8df9-53f5-a3c6-44e1869d2e75"))
  (text
    "   K-99695 doesn't join its jacks' pin 2 (§15 item 8), one zone's two"
    (at 15.24 198.69 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "617cb1fc-a332-516d-a5a4-d8c241268fd3"))
  (text
    "   ports take an isolated transceiver instead."
    (at 15.24 201.69 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "f4c7264a-a34e-558d-8e46-e9fbdb553ac4"))
  (text
    "3. Every DE has a 4.7k pull-down: no port drives while the RP2350 is in"
    (at 15.24 204.69 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "47180a54-7ec6-525e-afa8-0e5b419e8075"))
  (text
    "   reset or booting (erratum E9, §5, bench check 1)."
    (at 15.24 207.69 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "f0e40bd0-0d09-5944-a036-8e62aad0aaf1"))
  (text
    "4. RE is tied low, so each port hears its own echo (§5)."
    (at 15.24 210.69 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "7b2daf12-04b1-5695-bbec-01ed50970c5e"))
  (text
    "5. Bias resistors (TBD) are not fitted until their values are set:"
    (at 15.24 213.69 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "1e378f45-c5be-5d0f-8db1-920b574e1a40"))
  (text
    "   valve segments in Phase 3, the panel with the panel (§5, §16)."
    (at 15.24 216.69 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "e99f7469-f65d-507f-be3b-db1e20ce4745"))
  (text
    "6. 120R terminates every port at the controller end (§5)."
    (at 15.24 219.69 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "1d499b4a-3dfc-57e5-b986-9996545601ec"))
  (text
    "7. GPIO map is HARDWARE.md §8, proposed [I]."
    (at 15.24 222.69 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "c6238662-cfb6-5f5a-b84a-c5820b57e206"))
  (text
    "8. THVD1410 pin numbers: TI's datasheet, Pin Functions, DGK [V]."
    (at 15.24 225.69 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "4c40507f-5afb-5b0d-8fa1-c7fb596746a7"))
  (text
    "9. Connector pin 1 and 6 of each valve jack are not wired (§11)."
    (at 15.24 228.69 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "ab6a70c6-79bb-5c2e-9ac0-c264c88bd98b"))
  (sheet_instances (path "/" (page "1"))))
